// Translations: "Diagnostics on Resistance Clockwork are complete. Clockwork's task is to reprogram the Resistance Clockwork.", "The efficiency of the target Resistance Clockwork is less than that required of Praetoria's Clockwork. Shutdown the Resistance Clockwork, reprogram the Resistance Clockwork and repair the Resistance Clockwork.", "Why do Resistance Clockwork attack Clockwork? If Resistance Clockwork did not attack Clockwork, then Clockwork would not need to repair Resistance Clockwork.", "Diagnostics on the Resistance Clockwork are complete. Repairs on the Resistance Clockwork are complete. Reprogramming of the Resistance Clockwork is complete. Resistance Clockwork is now Praetoria's Clockwork. Clockwork task is to initialize the Praetoria's Clockwork."

