// Translations: "The target Resistance Clockwork is not shutdown. Clockwork's task is to attack the Resistance Clockwork.", "If target Resistance Clockwork is not shutdown then the clockwork task to attack the Resistance Clockwork is more important than the task to repair the Resistance Clockwork.", "If the Resistance steals the Resistance Clockwork, then the Resistance will repair the Resistance Clockwork but not reprogram the Resistance Clockwork. The Resistance will not steal the Resistance Clockwork."

