// Translations: "Diagnostics on Praetoria's Clockwork are complete. Clockwork's task is to repair the Praetoria's Clockwork.", "The efficiency of the target Praetoria's Clockwork is less than the efficiency required of Praetoria's Clockwork. Shutdown the Praetoria's Clockwork and repair it.", "Why do Neuron's attack clockwork? If Neuron's did not attack clockwork, then clockwork do not need to repair Praetoria's Clockwork." "Diagnostics on Praetoria's Clockwork are complete. Repairs on Praetoria's Clockwork are complete. Clockwork's task is to initialize the Antimatter Clockwork."

