// Translations: "Why is the Resistance task to break objects?", "The clockwork's task is to fix the object. Why is the entity attacking the clockwork?", "Suspending the clockwork's task to fix the object. Initiating the clockwork's task to combat the entity.", "If the clockwork's target is dead, then the clockwork's task is to fix the Underground."

